# Twinned Vision's flashback needs a card to discard (CR 118.8, 601.2h): with an empty hand it is not offered even though the mana
# is there. T1: six artifacts and Vision are the opening hand; Mox Ruby + Mox Sapphire pay for Vision from the hand, which draws a
# Forest that is played, leaving the hand empty. Black Lotus (untapped, three blue) could pay the flashback, yet `!` holds. T3 is the
# positive control: the turn's draw (an Island) is in hand, the flashback is cast with Lotus blue, the Island is discarded as its
# cost and the two cards drawn (Swamp, Plains) are exactly the hand left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Twinned Vision
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Forest
Island
Swamp
Plains
Swamp x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

